      "text": "[8:57PM] #AirportRd #TrafficUpdate \n\nCongested but slow-moving traffic from NNPC Junction inward to Canoe, extending through Chivita, Lookman Atobajehun, Swimming Pool, Hollandia Way, Ajibade Babatola, and Eleganza Roundabout, connecting to Asa Afariogun Street, inward to Lateef Salami Street.\nGood traffic flow from Awoniyi Elemo Junction, Fatai Irawo Junction, inward to the main carriageway, towards 7&8 Junction.\nSmooth movement from Aye Junction inward Osolo Way, Aswani Market, down to Aswani Roundabout, and further down to Asa Afariogun Junction by OZDE Plaza.\nGood traffic conditions on Oshodi Express inward to Apakun Nacho International Airport Road, with both inward and outward main carriageways moving efficiently.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
