      "text": "[9:18PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic flow along the service lane of Anthony, for both inward and outward journeys, from Maryland Intersection to Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, respectively.\nSmooth movement on Oba Akran Road, Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, and Oba Akinjobi Way in Ikeja G.R.A., as well as in and out of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\nEfficient traffic conditions on Oba Akran Link Bridge and Airport Link Bridge.\n\nTraffic personnel are actively on ground, working to ensure a smooth flow of traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
