      "text": "[9:44PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nFaster vehicular movement from Custom Checkpoint to Agbara, inward to Morogbo, with a smooth return journey at the moment.\nImproved traffic conditions from Morogbo down to Ajibade, en route to Odofa, towards Church Gate, Ibiye, Magbon, Oko Afo, all the way to Badagry Roundabout.\nGood traffic flow from Badagry Roundabout, connecting Joseph Dosu Way, down to Badagry Market.\n\nNo impediments have been reported, and traffic officers are actively on ground to ensure a smooth flow of traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
